  "integration": "Native React ContactContent on /kontakt with shared six-language navigation and calculator. The original calm D3 vector-map design is restored: original supplied geometry around Schaffhausen and official swisstopo vector tiles beyond that extent, rendered with the same palette. Live Swiss geocoding remains connected; server-only openrouteservice routing is prepared, but no private key is configured. No raster/WMS or additional map rendering engine is used. Original supplied image/data/vendor/license files remain unchanged; new decoder licenses are recorded separately.",
